SUMMARY:Deadline: Screen South Showcase Artists 2026-27\, Round 2 (digital 
 creative bursaries up to GBP 1\,500)
DESCRIPTION:Screen South supports digital creative projects (visual\, immer
 sive and sound-based) that are already underway and can be shown within si
 x months\; linear film is unlikely to be funded. ELIGIBILITY: artists base
 d in South East England\, excluding London. OFFER: bursaries up to GBP 1\,
 500 and possible exhibition space in Dover.\n\nOrganisation: Screen South\
 nLocation: South East England (excluding London)\; possible exhibition spa
 ce in Dover.\nAward: Bursaries up to GBP 1\,500 plus possible exhibition s
 pace.\nDuration: Projects shown within 6 months\n\nMore: https://screensou
 th.org/events/screen-south-showcase-artists-2026-7-open-call/?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
