SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 GMT: Arts Council of Northern Ireland: Individual Ar
 tists Digital Evolution Awards 2026/27 (up to GBP 10\,000 for digital art)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 26 Nov 2026 at 12:00 GMT.\n\nA National Lottery award fr
 om the Arts Council of Northern Ireland for individual artists to make dig
 ital art and build skills in new media and immersive practice. WHAT COUNTS
 : art created exclusively in the digital space\, or translated into physic
 al form through technology\, including AR and VR\, 3D and digital creation
 \, data-driven work and app-based art.\n\nOrganisation: Arts Council of No
 rthern Ireland (National Lottery funded)\nLocation: Northern Ireland. Appl
 icants must live in Northern Ireland.\nAward: Up to GBP 10\,000 per award.
  The applicant's own artist fees can be budgeted at up to GBP 125 a day or
  GBP 500 a week. No application fee stated.\nDuration: Projects take place
  between 1 March 2027 and 29 February 2028\n\nMore: https://artscouncil-ni
 .org/funding-for-individuals/individual-artists-digital-evolution-awards?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://artscouncil-ni.org/funding-for-individuals/individual-artists-d
 igital-evolution-awards?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
LOCATION:Northern Ireland. Applicants must live in Northern Ireland.
END:VEVENT
